⑦ Comandos Disponibles (5)

/ia4d-functional-design-expert:fd-from-legacy
Generate a Functional Design document from legacy code sources. Optimized for COBOL, VB6, SQLWindows, AngularJS, and other legacy technology stacks.

Ejemplo:
/fd-from-legacy --context ./cobol/billing --tech cobol --project BILLING
/ia4d-functional-design-expert:fd-from-requirements
Generate a Functional Design document from requirements sources: Word documents, PDFs, existing functional specs, user stories, JIRA exports, or plain text descriptions.

Ejemplo:
/fd-from-requirements --input ./docs/functional-requirements-v3.pdf --project BILLING
/ia4d-functional-design-expert:fd-from-ux
Generate a Functional Design document from UX/UI design sources. Supports Figma URLs, Sketch files, mockup images, and wireframe screenshots.

Ejemplo:
/fd-from-ux --url https://figma.com/file/abc123/Orders-App --project ORDERS
/ia4d-functional-design-expert:generate-fd
Generate a complete Functional Design document from any source. Auto-detects source type and orchestrates the full extraction-writing-validation pipeline.

Ejemplo:
/generate-fd
/ia4d-functional-design-expert:validate-fd
Validate the completeness and quality of an existing Functional Design document. Runs a 30-point checklist and produces a scored quality report with specific gap identification.

Ejemplo:
/validate-fd ./docs/FD-ORDERS-001.md